Executive Summary
The Socrati ecommerce platform has a solid foundation: customers can browse products, add to cart, checkout, and pay. Admins can manage products and view orders. However, several modules that are standard on any ecommerce platform are either incomplete or do not exist yet. This brief outlines those gaps.

What Is Already Working ✅
- Customers can browse, search, and filter products
- Product pages with size/colour variants, images, and pricing
- Shopping cart and guest/logged-in checkout
- Payment processing (PayFast + Peach Payments)
- Order tracking with statuses (Pending → Shipped → Delivered)
- Admin can add, edit, and delete products with images and stock
- Admin can view orders and payments
- Basic user accounts (register, login, addresses)
