What Needs to Be Built
✅ 📧 Email Notifications — Built
- Order confirmation emails (Customer & Admin)
- Shipping / Status update notifications
- Welcome and Account-related emails
- Low-stock alerts for inventory management
- Admin Email Monitoring Log for auditing all communications
🏷️ Coupon & Discount System — Not Built
Business impact: There is no way to run promotions, offer discounts, or reward loyal customers. This is a standard feature on every ecommerce platform.
What's needed:
- Ability to create discount codes (percentage off, fixed amount off)
- Set rules: minimum order value, expiry date, maximum number of uses
- Customers can enter a coupon code at checkout
- Admin dashboard to manage and track all coupons
- Usage reporting (how many times each code was used, revenue impact)
-
📈 Reporting & Analytics — Not Built
Business impact: The current dashboard shows only all-time totals with no ability to filter by date. Business decisions cannot be made from this data. Growth figures shown are fake placeholders.
What's needed:
- Daily, weekly, monthly and custom date range reporting
- Revenue over time (chart)
- Number of orders over time (chart)
- Top-selling products
- Best customers by spend
- Average order value
- Sales by product category
- Ability to export any report to a spreadsheet
✅ 🖼️ Media Management — Built
Business impact: Admins can upload product images but cannot browse, organise, or delete them. Every upload creates a new file even if the same image already exists.
What's needed:
- A central media library where all uploaded images are visible
- Ability to delete images no longer in use
- Ability to reuse an existing image on multiple products without re-uploading
- Drag-and-drop ordering of product gallery images
✅ 👤 User Management — Built
Business impact: Admins can see users and toggle them between customer and admin. However, several standard features a customer expects are missing.
What's needed:
- Forgot password / reset password flow (currently impossible to recover an account)
- Email verification on registration
- Ability for admin to suspend an account without deleting it
- Admin view of a specific customer's full profile, order history, and total spend
- Delete user button (exists on screen but does not work)
✅ 📦 Product Management — Built
Business impact: Minor gaps that limit admin efficiency and marketing flexibility.
What's needed:
- Sale pricing (ability to set a sale price and schedule sale dates)
- Product tags for better filtering and promotions
- Bulk actions (select multiple products and delete/update) — currently broken
- Activate / deactivate a product without deleting it
- Ability to moderate and respond to customer reviews
- Duplicate a product quickly
✅ 🗄️ Inventory Management — Built
Business impact: Stock levels are visible but there are no proper management tools, no alerts, and no history.
What's needed:
- A dedicated inventory screen listing all products and stock levels in one place
- Ability to edit stock quantities directly from the inventory screen (without going into each product)
- Automatic stock reduction when an order is placed (needs verification that this is working)
- Configurable low-stock warning threshold per product
- Stock change history so admins can see when and why stock changed
- Bulk stock update via spreadsheet import
